<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-19T13:38:42.814Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:38:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi forces have reached a compromise with the pro-Iran militia Kataib Hezbollah and are deploying a joint security command in Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has ordered a new security command in the area. Security officials arrested the oil pipeline chief on smuggling allegations and placed forces on alert as the Jurf al-Sakhar command prepares to start operations on Friday. ISIS remnants faced airstrikes in Anbar province and tribes warned against further security changes, as nearly one million Iraqis registered firearms. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQeE81RHNyWV9Jc2dPbDFQR29pcEhYZlJCc1JFR1JsT1ctM2h2MG1aaEJ0dGk3a3VobmtWYzMtWW45ZGNPaXF0YlFUbDQzMUZpRmVONzBsY2M1SS04b0VZVnZ3V2N6S0l4UC03MWRkSVdGWVN2czdYTWxab1phZC0wa2k1RHJLTTBHM2Jla1BpVW4tQkdUdWR1QWdkWlI3ZEVCQnozOS1HUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNbHE0UC1UY21ZTFJ5TWg4MFNtM1VZc215bjVzbWdOdXBnNXM2eXJUajVhdS0tLUhpcVZWVkE3dng3RHNQT1A1NWF0ZGJTY1hGRHFiaFJaRTItakI1X2hZVUQ0bzJKM1o4ME5xR2ltVkN4bmpGQnNtc3JRd0NiVWlWUWhJdlQtbWJpa3BzZXRvajVNNDdhclBHM0xaZEUxNHpUcXpia3NVeFpVMmFyWEdsd0Z1QV81OEFrMVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPazdzQzVaMFd1ZDNwQWVMYU83Qk5Ma0Zzazhpa0NKSlJ6QXNVS3k3STdpTFM0M1lORHhjSjFIM3FBSDFqMWZwZEwySnpWb2FxQWFGbW5xSW5vV2dNZjhMZVZmZGpfOXFwRWJVczgtU20xWndHc1NsQ0c3WlhISlZPcEFqSGYyX05Eb3F5SjJ4eXU2UzVjQUpIeDRlaEpTSDdPcTJxa1oxTk1DN3oyMTFFMTNjUExsNG1jcTFhbG01SUd4b2hDdWl3?oc=5&quot;&gt;アラブニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo